{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t亞殘運輪椅劍擊項目，港隊在混合重劍團體賽銅牌賽不敵泰國，得第四名。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n港隊的陳㬢、鄺遠興、湯雅婷及余翠怡，四強以12:20敗於國家隊，轉戰銅牌賽面對泰國。最終以14:20落敗，無緣獎牌。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n<ul><li>主頁</li></ul></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:42:33.944948+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:12:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T23:18:32.277074+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:52.341088+00:00","content_hash":"712efa1fde1bb8fbff3b5d3d65363085a8787a0f78245a7cb56e91f82632d7b0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}